{"reviews":[{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-0","r":5.0,"t":"Good Product","x":"I have used this product for years it does the job it is designed for very well.","h":27,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-1","r":5.0,"t":"Best value","x":"Ivw always bought this from Amazon because it's the best values","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-2","r":5.0,"t":"Good value.","x":"Very good price point. I usually can\u2019t find in store.","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-3","r":5.0,"t":"Works as advertised","x":"Product was delivered on time and works great","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-4","r":2.0,"t":"Product works","x":"My problem isn\u2019t with the product; it\u2019s with the description. It states it is for 3-1 oz tubes. However what he shows, and what was received, was 3-.25 oz tubes. You can get 5 tubes, 1 oz each, for $30\u2026why would anybody spend $20 for 3-.25 oz? Product returned. Waiting for refund.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-5","r":5.0,"t":"good price","x":"This is usually this same price for about 1/4 of the same same here I bought it for one of my clients","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-6","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent!","x":"If you are a new denture wearer, this stuff is a must-have!!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-7","r":5.0,"t":"Best cream for painful Dentures","x":"Benzodent is the best cream for dentures that are old and fit poorly.  Yes, it IS better to get new ones, but there are times when they just are not in your budget.  So you have two choices: either stop eating (not fun) or find a way to relieve the pain until you can get new dentures.  Benzodent is great for that situation!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-8","r":5.0,"t":"PACKAGING??????","x":"Benzodent Dental Pain Relieving Cream, 1 Ounce - Pack of 3 is a great product, I use it every day. Is it possible to request that I only receive it in the plastic tube? The metal tube almost always splits and product is wasted and it's a bit expensive to be wasting and the cream turns black, that's not very appealing, I'm sure it's a chemical reaction of some sort. The plastic tube is far superior and I prefer it 1,000,000 to 1. I've tried to locate the package description on all listings and it","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-9","r":5.0,"t":"Benzodent works best for mouth issues","x":"Always the best product when you have any mouth issues. I\u2019ve been using it for many years and even though I\u2018ve tried other products, I would not even think of using anything else but Benzodent for my mouth because it really works.  I highly recommend it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-10","r":5.0,"t":"Nothing works better. It came as scheduled and I'm very","x":"Used Benzodent for years.  Nothing works better.  It came as scheduled and I'm very happy","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-11","r":5.0,"t":"Dentures sores","x":"It is a great product for dentures sore.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-12","r":4.0,"t":"Healing gums","x":"I used this product while my gums were healing. New dentures can be a bit painful and have to be removed once in a while to rinse out your mouth. This product provided comfortable removal of dentures and was easy to clean off of the dentures. It has now been almost 3 months and while the product served its purpose I find it does not hold in the dentures as well as other adhesive products. I think concrete wouldn't hold in the bottom dentures, lol.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-13","r":5.0,"t":"A very helpful  product for irritated  gums.","x":"Benzodent dental was great for the price. It is very reliable  for irritated gums. I was given this product after having surgery on my gums and I  will continue using it whenever my gums get irritated.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-14","r":5.0,"t":"\ud83d\udc4c","x":"Anyone with braces or dentures needs to have this product on hand. It is awesome","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-15","r":5.0,"t":"Is the best pain killer for gums","x":"I had 8 teeth pulled and it has really helped me get through this.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-16","r":5.0,"t":"Benzodent is the best. Nothing else compares!","x":"Benzodent is the best. I have tried other so called pain relievers for dentures and there is nothing out there that compares to or works as good as Benzodent. I'm just sad that I can no longer buy it in the stores but very happy I can still get it through Amazon. I try to make sure that I always have it on hand. It definitely works wonders. I always keep some in my purse and I always have it in the house.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-17","r":5.0,"t":"Benzodent.","x":"This is a new Item I am trying for sore in the mouth, Its much better than the GEL.....It does heal faster, and without that get alchole taste..Would recommend better than the gel...Even for a Tooth Ach...last longer also.....Great. Item......Found it on Amazon....Thank you Amazon for carring this........","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-18","r":3.0,"t":"Too thick","x":"It works ok for pain relief while wearing dentures. But it's too thick. It's so thick, it's like putty and it moves when i put my dentures in. It's not really a waste of money for me, i'll use it even though it doesn't stay put.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-19","r":5.0,"t":"Relief","x":"For my dentures. Could never find in the stores n was told it had been discontinued by the manufacture.  Was very pleased to find on line as it was the only medication that relieved the pain n healing on my gums.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-20","r":5.0,"t":"A must for denture wearers.","x":"Have tried all the pain relievers for oral pain. None work as well as benzodent. Stops my pain for hours. Would recommend to anyone who suffers with denture pain. Try it you will not be sorry.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great Med!  It really helps!","x":"This cream for your sore gums really works and it only takes a tiny portion on the sore spot.  So helpful to anyone with dentures and/or partials.  It really helpsAND i HIGHLY RECOMMEND IT!.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-22","r":5.0,"t":"The best for pain relief","x":"This product id terrific for pain caused by loose or ill fitting dentures. long lasting and a great value. A little goes a long way! I have used this for years and am very satisfied!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-23","r":5.0,"t":"A real lifesaver","x":"A real lifesaver! I recently got dentures and this cream made the healing process bearable and still helps on days that I\u2019m tender. I\u2019ve recommended it to several friends and family.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B01M1LB9A3-24","r":5.0,"t":"Sore gums","x":"I had a partial plate made which aggravated my gums so it was suggested to try this product. I use it to put my plate in and it helps to numb the area.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers widely praise the product as effective and reliable for denture and gum issues, with many long-term users recommending it.","cites":[1,7,8,10,11,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many customers highlight the good value and price point.","cites":[2,3,6,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the product works as advertised and arrived on time.","cites":[4,11]},{"text":"One reviewer complained that the description was inaccurate about tube sizes and returned the product.","cites":[5]},{"text":"One reviewer praised the product but requested plastic tubes instead of metal ones, which split and waste product.","cites":[9]}]},"qa":[]}